/**
 * ImportIncidentsModal
 * ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * 3-step wizard to import medical incidents from an Excel / CSV file.
 *
 *   Step 1 – Upload file  (waits for form options to load)
 *   Step 2 – Map & Preview  (all mapped fields shown, resolve dept dropdowns)
 *   Step 3 – Confirm & Import
 * ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 */

